  "bodyHash": "629e1c101837528f",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 模组。用心打造。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于本模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">“Let's Parkour”为游戏添加了多种跑酷方块，用于打造精彩的跑酷赛道。本模组专为 ModFest: Carnival 活动制作。它为玩家提供了让跑酷赛道更加有趣的工具。通过在上方叠加更多台阶，可以增强每个方块的特效。各项跑酷方块可单独启用或禁用。<br><br>目前包含慢速、快速、跳跃、柔软、果冻、光滑、幻象和活板门跑酷方块。请参阅下方的合成表及其功能说明。<br></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/lets-parkour/a.webp\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">通过叠加方块可以增强跑酷方块的特效：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/lets-parkour/a2.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg\" alt=\"环境：客户端与服务器\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableSlowParkourBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否启用慢速跑酷方块功能。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableFastParkourBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否启用快速跑酷方块功能。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableJumpParkourBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否启用跳跃跑酷方块功能。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableSoftParkourBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否启用柔软跑酷方块功能。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableJellyParkourBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否启用果冻跑酷方块功能。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableSlipperyParkourBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否启用光滑跑酷方块功能。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableTrapdoorParkourBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否启用活板门跑酷方块功能。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>slowBlockBaseSpeedFactor</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：0.5</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">慢速跑酷方块的基准速度系数。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>fastBlockBaseSpeedFactor</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：1.5</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">快速跑酷方块的基准速度系数。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>jumpBlockBaseJumpFactor</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：2.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">跳跃跑酷方块的基准跳跃系数。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>slipperyBlockBaseFrictionFactor</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：0.95</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">光滑跑酷方块的基准摩擦系数。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/description.svg\" alt=\"功能介绍\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>跑酷方块：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">基础跑酷台阶。可作为普通方块使用，并用于所有其他方块的合成。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/lets-parkour/b.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">慢速跑酷台阶会减缓玩家在其上方行走的速度。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/lets-parkour/c.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">快速跑酷台阶会加速玩家在其上方行走的速度。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/lets-parkour/d.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">跳跃跑酷台阶允许玩家在其上方时跳得更高。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/lets-parkour/e.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">柔软跑酷台阶可防止玩家落在上面时受到摔落伤害。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/lets-parkour/f.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">果冻跑酷台阶具有粘性，会减缓玩家在其中的移动速度。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/lets-parkour/g.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">光滑跑酷台阶摩擦力较小，会使玩家在上面滑动。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/lets-parkour/h.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">幻象跑酷台阶外观与基础跑酷方块相似，但玩家会直接穿过去。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/lets-parkour/i.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">活板门方块允许玩家在其上方短暂站立，随后会打开。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/lets-parkour/j.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">小心活板门跑酷方块！</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/lets-parkour/a3.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"注意事项与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下载源保持在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态内，您可以自由在任何整合包中使用本模组。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由于无法在如此多的独立模组页面中跟踪评论，评论区已关闭。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他反馈，请访问&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
